{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall not touch their carcasses.</b> The verse did not mention that one who touches becomes impure until evening; we know this only from received tradition [halakhah le-Moshe mi-Sinai]. Now, one who touches intentionally is liable to lashes, for he has transgressed a negative commandment."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:22.564437796Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}